  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_0591.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La tarde de este domingo se ha celebrado el concierto de intercambio de las bandas de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Ribesalbes y la de Traiguera, como cierre de las fiestas de San Crist&oacute;bal de 2014.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertintercanvibandesribesalbestraiguera/img_0569.jpg\" alt=\"img_0569\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertintercanvibandesribesalbestraiguera/img_0570.jpg\" alt=\"img_0570\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertintercanvibandesribesalbestraiguera/img_0571.jpg\" alt=\"img_0571\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertintercanvibandesribesalbestraiguera/img_0573.jpg\" alt=\"img_0573\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertintercanvibandesribesalbestraiguera/img_0574.jpg\" alt=\"img_0574\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertintercanvibandesribesalbestraiguera/img_0575.jpg\" alt=\"img_0575\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertintercanvibandesribesalbestraiguera/img_0576.jpg\" alt=\"img_0576\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertintercanvibandesribesalbestraiguera/img_0578.jpg\" alt=\"img_0578\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><i